# Repository files are hashed by byte: index.json records a sha256 of each
# plugin.js and of each sidecar icon (icon.svg / icon.png), and the gateway
# verifies them after download. Checkout must keep the stored bytes, or a
# Windows working copy would disagree with the hash.
#
# eol=lf applies to the text files. A binary sidecar icon is left alone: it
# carries NUL bytes, so `text=auto` classifies it as binary and never rewrites
# its line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
